40573423,9,What type of samples were sequenced?,Plasma or serum,"Viral RNA was extracted from 140 μL of plasma or serum using the QIAcube extraction system (QIAGEN, Hilden, Germany), according to the manufacturer's instructions.",The paper specifies that viral RNA was extracted from plasma or serum samples using the QIAcube extraction system.
