40596906,1,Does the paper report HIV sequences from patient samples?,Yes,"The genotyping sequences were provided by the Brazilian Ministry of Health. The analyses included descriptions of antiretroviral resistance mutation profiles of the mothers and children, subtype determination, and phylogenetic analyses.","The paper discusses genotyping sequences provided by the Brazilian Ministry of Health, indicating that HIV sequences from patient samples were reported."
40596906,2,Does the paper report in vitro drug susceptibility data?,No,"The analyses included descriptions of antiretroviral resistance mutation profiles of the mothers and children, subtype determination, and phylogenetic analyses.",The paper focuses on sequences and mutation profiles rather than in vitro drug susceptibility data.
