40596906,5,From which countries were the sequenced samples obtained?,Brazil,"This study aimed to describe the transmission of drug-resistant HIV-1 variants and phylogenetic characterisation of viral strains in mother-child pairs from the cities of Recife and São Luís, located in the Northeast region of Brazil, in 2007–2022.","The paper specifies that the study was conducted in Brazil, particularly in the Northeast region."
40596906,6,From what years were the sequenced samples obtained?,2007–2022,"This study aimed to describe the transmission of drug-resistant HIV-1 variants and phylogenetic characterisation of viral strains in mother-child pairs from the cities of Recife and São Luís, located in the Northeast region of Brazil, in 2007–2022.",The paper states that the study was conducted from 2007 to 2022.
40596906,7,What method was used for sequencing?,ViroSeq Genotyping System,"Genotypic sequences of the HIV pol region (protease/reverse transcriptase-PR/RT) were obtained using the ViroSeq Genotyping System, carried out in the laboratories of the National Genotyping Network (RENAGENO) coordinated by the Department of HIV/AIDS of the Brazilian Ministry of Health.",The paper mentions the ViroSeq Genotyping System as the method used for sequencing.
