40596906,11,Were the patients in the study in a clinical trial?,No,"This study included 15 mother-child pairs with confirmed vertical transmission of HIV-1. Data were obtained from secondary sources, including medical records from hospital and outpatient services where patients were followed.",The paper does not mention that the patients were part of a clinical trial.
