40763144,12,How many individuals had samples obtained for HIV sequencing?,295,"Of the 295 participants, 167 (56.6%) were female and the median age was 19 years (Inter quartile range (IQR: 13-41). The participants had been on ART for a median 8 years (IQR: 5-10) and 59.3% were on INSTIs at sample collection Majority of participants (65.4%) underwent HIVDR testing in 2023 following revised national criteria to test all PLHIV failing on ART regardless of treatment line.",295 individuals had records analyzed for the HIVDR study.”
40763144,13,Does the paper report HIV sequences from individuals who had previously received ARV drugs?,Yes,"We conducted a retrospective cross-sectional study in the West-Nile region of Uganda across the 161 health facilities that offer comprehensive ART services.  The region had a population of 3.6 million people in 2023 and an estimated 49,000 PLHIV [15]. Study participants included all PLHIV, regardless of age, who had been on ART for at least one year, had a non-suppressed HIV viral load (>1000 copies/ml) and underwent an HIVDR test between 1st January 2021–30th December 2023.",All study participants had been on ART for at least one year and had a history of virological failure.
40763144,14,Which drug classes were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"NRTIs, NNRTIs, PIs, INSTIs","Participants who had  no HIVDR had been on ART for a median of 8 years [15] and were receiving TDF/3TC/DTG,  (34.9% ), INSTIs (NNRTIs, NRTIs, PIs), Likewise, the participants who had no HIVDR mutation had spent 77% of their treatment time on second line and 6% on third line of treatment consequently had a higher mean WHO stage (I) and II (82%) [15] hence line of ARV treatment explains ( ART Regimen ) the low 26% MAJ for NRTIs 54.8%, NNRTIs 23.1%, INSTIs 14.8%.","The participants were receiving a combination of NRTIs, NNRTIs, PIs, and INSTIs as part of their ART regimens."
40763144,15,Which drugs were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"TDF, 3TC, DTG, ABC, ZDV, AZT, LPVr, ATVr","Participants who had  no HIVDR had been on ART for a median of 8 years [15] and were receiving TDF/3TC/DTG,  (34.9% ), INSTIs (NNRTIs, NRTIs, PIs), Likewise, the participants who had no HIVDR mutation had spent 77% of their treatment time on second line and 6% on third line of treatment consequently had a higher mean WHO stage (I) and II (82%) [15] hence line of ARV treatment explains ( ART Regimen ) the low 26% MAJ for NRTIs 54.8%, NNRTIs 23.1%, INSTIs 14.8%.","Participants were on a combination of TDF, 3TC, DTG, ABC, ZDV, AZT, LPVr, and ATVr."
